---
title: Resume
picture: fluke
layout: layouts/page.njk
description: The resume of Romit Raj Sahu.
---
{#- One card with a few words and the link to the resume itself (src/assets/files/resume.pdf, published at /resume.pdf). Its words are in _data/pages.json ("resume"). The link loads the PDF the ordinary way (data-taxi-ignore), not as a page change. -#}
<div class="page-grid" data-part="cards">
  <section class="panel page-grid__main" data-part="card">
    <h2 class="panel__title">{{ pages.resume.title }}</h2>
    <div class="panel__text">
      {%- for paragraph in pages.resume.paragraphs %}
      <p>{{ paragraph | fill | safe }}</p>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <a class="link panel__action" href="{{ downloads.resume }}" data-taxi-ignore>{{ pages.resume.link }}<span class="link__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
  </section>
</div>
